{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've woken up in your cheap hotel room, low on funds and equipment. The town where you currently reside is under attack by a dragon from a different game world. You and your teammates embark to slay the dragon for easy money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains only 2 worlds to explore, solve puzzles and complete side quests. Plus one flying level to connect both worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time combat with both range and melee.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Inventory System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable equipment layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable magic spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various quest lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varying aesthetics (Anime, Voxel and Pixelart).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rail shooter levels between worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different world settings.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016650?t=1758340211","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016650?t=1758340211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016650/1c5619cb0508a30d66a4f8991c9c6519259e863c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758340211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016650/1c5619cb0508a30d66a4f8991c9c6519259e863c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758340211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"descr